# Planning and design documents — kept local, not tracked.
#
# CLAUDE.md stays at the repository root: it is loaded automatically by the
# agent tooling from that path and is the one document that must travel with
# the repo.
#
# Note the pattern below is `docs/*` and not `docs/`. Git does not descend
# into an ignored directory, so `docs/` followed by a negation would silently
# match nothing. Ignoring the contents instead leaves the directory itself
# visible, which is what lets `!docs/adr/` work.
docs/*

# Architecture Decision Records ARE tracked. They are the durable record of
# why things are the way they are, and they have to survive a clone.
!docs/adr/

# Secrets. .env.example documents names only and IS tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# A fuller ignore file (Python, Node, Docker, editor artefacts) lands with the
# M0 repository skeleton.
